## Large Artifacts (The "Release" Bundle)
# We ignore the specific generated demo folder because it contains 
# large weights and tensors. 
# artifacts/release_demo/

# folder structure but not the files, 
artifacts/release_demo/**/*.pt
artifacts/release_demo/**/*.npy
artifacts/release_demo/**/*.parquet
artifacts/release_demo/**/*.json
artifacts/release_demo/**/*.csv
artifacts/release_demo/images



